        // NOTE (TC fork): the running TC 7.20 client reports 2026.07.22.0000.0000, which is
        // NOT listed below, so none of these opcodes are applied -- every OverlayPlugin
        // custom log line is inert on TC 7.20. This is deliberate: no TC 7.20 opcode data has
        // been published yet (HoshinoLYK/ffxiv-opcode-tc stops at v7.15 / 2026.06.15, pushed
        // 2026-06-23, a month before TC 7.20 shipped).
        // Do NOT simply rename the key to 2026.07.22 -- opcodes are reshuffled every patch and
        // wrong opcodes emit wrong log lines, which is worse than emitting none.
        // The 2026.06.15 set below was cross-checked against HoshinoLYK/ffxiv-opcode-tc
        // Ipcs.7.15.h and matches on all 7 comparable entries (ActorMove 0x36e, ActorSetPos
